+ @discussion Accepted keys are networkPredictionEnabled and hyperlinkAuditingEnabled (booleans),
+ and webRTCIPHandlingPolicy (one of the four supported policy strings). Omitted keys use the
+ current embedder preferences. An empty dictionary removes all overrides. Invalid input returns
+ NO without changing any override. WebRTC routing changes apply to new peer connections.
+ The embedder must resolve extension permissions, profile scope and precedence before applying
+ these effective values. Shared WKPreferences objects are not modified.
+ */
+- (BOOL)_setExtensionPrivacyPreferences:(NSDictionary<NSString *, id> *)overrides;
